---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
import { GITHUB_URL } from '../consts';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="Ahmed Bin Asim: a fullstack engineer in Pakistan becoming an AI agent security practitioner, and the ground rules he works under."
>
	<p>
		I'm Ahmed Bin Asim, a fullstack engineer based in Pakistan, working with US-timezone overlap.
		I'm becoming an AI agent security practitioner, and I'm early in that.
	</p>
	<p>
		I was the engineering lead and technical co-founder of RozMarrah, a student freelancing
		community that grew to 20,000+ students across Pakistan, and of Treva, an AI-native meeting
		notepad with live transcription. I studied CS at FAST-NUCES Islamabad and I work as a software
		engineer today.
	</p>
	<p>
		Before this I built a multi-agent lead-generation platform, an agent research workspace and a
		local multimodal search engine. Those repositories aren't public.
	</p>
	<p>Right now I'm building mcp-audit, an open-source static analyzer for MCP servers.</p>

	<h2>Ground rules</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>I test only my own systems and purpose-built labs.</li>
		<li>
			On other people's code I do static analysis only. I never probe someone else's running
			server.
		</li>
		<li>
			If I find a vulnerability, I report it to the maintainers privately first and follow a
			90-day disclosure norm.
		</li>
		<li>I never use employer code or data.</li>
	</ul>

	<p>
		My code is on <a href={GITHUB_URL}>GitHub</a>. New entries also arrive by
		<a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>.
	</p>
</Layout>
